      "writtenOn": "2018-11-06T16:33:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In general, there is concern over how coupled this design is to a very specific set of OF flows. This design isn\u0027t very extensible to support abstracted flows that may present itself over time. I am wandering if we can identify flows for storage in the KV using any more abstract information from the flow, i.e. can the logical flow id be used?",
