      "message": "I believe that \u003cresource_mgr\u003e is an OpenOltResourceManager instance here which is not a derived class of Common Resource Manager. This means that \"common\" TechProfile will have OpenOLT-specific functions. It may be better to pass a common resource manager to the TechProfile. But, that would also mean you would need multiple TPs: one per resourcemanager instance.\n\nAn alternative, is to make TechProfile a member attribute of Common Resource Manager that is referenced through indirection via the pon-if to openoltresoucemanager.",
